# bms_changes.patch - BMS Browser Modifications to Chromium
# Version: 1.0.0
# Description: Patches to integrate BMS DOM engine, search system, and BMS features
# Apply with: git apply bms_changes.patch

From: BMS Browser Team <bms@browser.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] BMS Browser: Custom DOM engine, search integration, and BMS features

This patch modifies Chromium to integrate the BMS DOM engine,
custom search system, and BMS-specific features including:
- Custom BMS DOM node implementation
- Global search engine integration
- BMS ignore system
- Custom API handlers
- Enhanced layout engine

